# Release Build Requirement

For any change that affects runtime library behavior, do not push a release/version bump unless distributable artifacts are rebuilt and included.

- If source under `src/` changes behavior consumed by package users, run `npm run build` before push.
- Confirm `dist/` reflects the source fix (spot-check expected strings/symbols in built files when relevant).
- When bumping package version, ensure `package.json`, `package-lock.json`, and updated `dist/*` are committed together.
- If build output is missing from the commit, treat release as incomplete and fix before pushing.

